WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,240
I also have a friend called Shengsheng

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,640
I’ll introduce you to him another day

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,940
He is also a cheerful person, right?

4
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,640
Then I must get to know each other, right?

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,840
I forgot to take the Gyokuro Ginger, you eat it first

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:22,340
Being away from home for such a long time

7
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,010
I don’t know how my parents and Yaoyao are doing.

8
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:26,210
There are also double rhymes

9
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,400
I hope you can heal well again

10
00:00:28,400 --> 00:01:04,680
Although my parents and sister can't be with me

11
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,350
But these little guys

12
00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:08,590
Also my family
